        },
        {
          "dimension": "Liquidity",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "Forced delisting of non-MiCA stablecoins by Coinbase, Binance, and Kraken's review of Tether removes the most-traded assets from EU venues, fragmenting liquidity from global markets.",
