        },
        {
          "dimension": "Market",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "ECB warnings that US stablecoins could drain EU capital and Trump's 20% tariff on the EU signal macroeconomic and geopolitical crosswinds that could suppress EU crypto asset valuations independently of project fundamentals.",
